1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,560
Kirim closing ke Meta lewat
server, bukan cuma pixel.

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:09,854
Buka Events Manager, pilih pixel
kamu, salin Pixel ID.

3
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:16,133
Masuk Settings, cari Conversions API,
klik Generate access token.

4
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:17,937
Salin tokennya.

5
00:00:17,937 --> 00:00:20,150
Meta cuma menampilkannya sekali.

6
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:26,078
Di Konektor, buka Tracking Website,
lalu Tambah platform iklan.

7
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,998
Pilih Meta, Facebook dan Instagram.

8
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:34,352
Isi nama, tempel Pixel ID, lalu
tempel Access Token.

9
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:36,014
Klik Simpan.

10
00:00:36,014 --> 00:00:39,000
Status Menunggu, sampai
event pertama masuk.

11
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,224
Mau cek sekarang?

12
00:00:41,224 --> 00:00:42,093
Pilih Uji kirim.

13
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:45,875
Tempel Test Event Code dari Events
Manager, lalu kirim.

14
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:48,924
Test Event terkirim.

15
00:00:48,924 --> 00:00:50,580
Event-nya muncul di Meta.

16
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:55,980
Panduannya, di konektor.id.
